---
source: tui/src/keymap_setup.rs
expression: snapshot
---
Open Transcript | ctrl-t | Global open_transcript Open Transcript Open the transcript overlay. ctrl-t Default
Open External Editor | ctrl-g | Global open_external_editor Open External Editor Open the current draft in an external editor. ctrl-g Default
Open Snippets | ctrl-s | Global open_snippets Open Snippets Open snippets from the last agent response. ctrl-s Default
Open Touched Paths | alt-p | Global open_touched_paths Open Touched Paths Open recently touched agent paths. alt-p Default
Open Model Picker | ctrl-m | Global open_model_picker Open Model Picker Open the model picker. ctrl-m Default
Copy | ctrl-o | Global copy Copy Copy the last agent response to the clipboard. ctrl-o Default
Redraw Full Scrollback | alt-l | Global redraw_full_scrollback Redraw Full Scrollback Redraw the full retained backlog for the current native scrollback view. alt-l Default
Clear Terminal | ctrl-l | Global clear_terminal Clear Terminal Clear the terminal UI. ctrl-l Default
Reload Current Session | ctrl-r | Global reload_current_session Reload Current Session Reload the current session in a fresh process. ctrl-r Default
Toggle Condensed Transcript | alt-c | Global toggle_condensed_transcript Toggle Condensed Transcript Toggle message-only main transcript view. alt-c Default
Toggle Vim Mode | unbound | Global toggle_vim_mode Toggle Vim Mode Turn Vim composer mode on or off. unbound Default
Toggle Raw Output | unbound | Global toggle_raw_output Toggle Raw Output Toggle raw scrollback mode. unbound Default
